      en: ["Valpovo was first mentioned in historical documents in the year 1431.", "The Prandau-Normann Castle features a medieval tower integrated into the palace.", "Valpovo's landscape park covers 25 hectares and is a protected monument.", "During the Ottoman rule, Valpovo was the seat of a Sanjak (administrative district).", "The 'Valpovo Summer' folklore festival has been held annually since 1968.", "The town is located in the fertile plains near the Drava River in Slavonia."],
